1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,040
Isn't it strange? You are not the same person you once were. Too much has changed. Too much had to.

2
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:14,780
So don't expect from yourself what you once embodied, that version of you no longer exists.

3
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:20,220
Maybe what you lost shaped you. And what you buried set you free.
